Modifications by ANEMLL (the snake and tetris builds only): LoRA + readout-head fine-tuning with this
project's own training code on Apple M5 Max (PyTorch MPS), merge, and conversion of all three builds to
Core AI (.aimodel) FP16 packages for the Apple Neural Engine. The base build is jeff-base v1.3 converted
without fine-tuning. The snake and tetris adapters were trained by ANEMLL locally (no Unsloth, no Colab).

Tetris training labels come from the El-Tetris heuristic by Islam El-Ashi (2011), an improvement on
Pierre Dellacherie's algorithm: https://imake.ninja/el-tetris-an-improvement-on-pierre-dellacheries-algorithm/
No third-party dataset is used.

